WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.777
Mahler's volume conjecture.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.919
A shape and its dual. Push the disk

3
00:00:04.919 --> 00:00:06.774
to a square; the volume product falls.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.741
Fit a round ball inside the body

5
00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:12.681
times its dual; volume does the rest.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.569
Claimed: no symmetric body goes lower.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.127
Main theorem Lean-checked.
